{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>And it was, when the ark set forward</b> — the vav of ויהי (and it was) is for the nations when it set forward. And ויהי עולה (rises to) 31, for He waged war with 31 kings." "<b>When it set forward</b> — teaches that it would sway to and fro and would not depart from its place until he would say, 'Rise up, YHWH.' When the ark set forward — when the ark journeys, it conveys with it the Chariot and the holy beasts." "<b>When it set forward</b> — by atbash: חשמ״ל. בנסע by alef-bet / bet-shin, שטח״ז, which is in gematria ככבוד המרכבה (like the glory of the Chariot)." "<b>When it set forward</b> — in gematria יעקב (Jacob), for the likeness of Jacob which is engraved upon the Throne of Glory journeys with them."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:48.656518771Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}